// newtLabelInputLine: the NewtApp labelled input line for text (NPR 2.0): a one-line
// field with a label at its left, editing target.(path) of the current entry.  With
// labelCommands the label is a picker (a diamond at its left).  Like
// protoLabelInputLine, but built on newtProtoLine.
//
// This file holds newtLabelInputLine and what only it reaches.

// flavor: the NewtApp filter that makes and reads the text (newtFilter)
newtLabelInputLine := {_proto: @newtProtoLine, flavor: @newtTextFilter};
